# Ministral 3 3B instruct (mistralai/Ministral-3-3B-Instruct-2512-BF16: 3.4B language model plus a
# 0.4B vision encoder; Apache-2.0), official bf16 checkpoint in Hugging Face format (the
# consolidated/Mistral-format copy in the same repo is not downloaded): the Mistral point of the
# speed/quality study (reports/speed_quality/). No thinking mode. --language-model-only skips the
# vision encoder; --max-num-batched-tokens=1024 and --max-num-seqs=16 as in the other presets;
# --generation-config=vllm ignores the upload's sampling defaults; 0.90 of the GPU.
# NOT SERVABLE by the pinned image: vLLM 0.30.0's pixtral.py imports PixtralRotaryEmbedding, which
# the image's transformers 5.17.0 renamed PixtralVisionRotaryEmbedding, so every Mistral3/Pixtral
# checkpoint fails at model inspection (docs/research/candidates.md). Kept for a newer image.
JEVEMU_VLLM_MODEL=mistralai/Ministral-3-3B-Instruct-2512-BF16
JEVEMU_VLLM_MODEL_REVISION=b6d637bef2393152b3da2b2fde72eecdee30557e
JEVEMU_VLLM_DTYPE=bfloat16
JEVEMU_VLLM_MAX_MODEL_LEN=8192
JEVEMU_VLLM_GPU_MEMORY_UTILIZATION=0.90
JEVEMU_VLLM_DEFAULT_CHAT_TEMPLATE_KWARGS=
JEVEMU_VLLM_EXTRA_ARGS='--language-model-only --max-num-seqs=16 --max-num-batched-tokens=1024 --generation-config=vllm'
